  "question": "A rope can bear a maximum tension of $300$ N. With what maximum acceleration, in $\\text{m/s}^2$, can a $20$ kg monkey climb up the rope? ($g = 10\\ \\text{m/s}^2$)",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [],
  "answer": "",
  "numerical_answer": "5",
  "tolerance": "0",
  "solution": "$$T - mg = ma \\;\\Rightarrow\\; a_{max} = \\frac{300 - 200}{20} = 5\\ \\text{m/s}^2$$",
